  "description": "Material Design UI controls for .NET MAUI with native rendering. Inspired by MudBlazor — includes FlavorTextField (floating labels, input masks, validation, adornments, 3 variants), FlavorButton, FlavorIconButton, FlavorFab, and FlavorFabMenu (speed dial). Supports dark theme, dense mode, ripple effects, and preset color/size tokens. See the sample app: https://github.com/mistrypragnesh40/Flavor.Maui.Demo",
